# 换行符：脚本类文件强制 LF。
# 原因：gradlew / *.sh 若以 CRLF 入库，macOS/Linux 上 shebang 会变成 "/bin/bash^M"，
# 直接报 bad interpreter。详见 docs/ARCHITECTURE.md 的构建章节。
*.sh text eol=lf
android/gradlew text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf

# 明确声明二进制，禁止 git 做换行转换或文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.ipa binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
